WEBVTT

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:05.090
Let's go.

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:06.240
Okay.

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:12.160
They're here.

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:16.500
Maybe I should go get them.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:21.280
They seem to be struggling.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.390
Hotsuma-kun, what's wrong?

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:30.680
That wound...

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.300
I'm fine.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:37.980
I can't rest when Shusei might be killed...

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:41.500
He's waiting!

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:45.070
Idiot, don't push yourself!

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:46.030
I'm fine.

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:49.320
I want to save Shusei-kun, too.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.250
I'm all right.

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:59.710
Anyway, I've got this.

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:01.750
That's...

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:04.020
You held on to it?

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:07.580
Sh-Shusei made me take it.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:14.560
Besides, using this,
I can sense where he is.

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:22.650
Emotional reunion in...

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:24.150
three...

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.400
two...

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:27.070
one...

00:01:27.530 --> 00:01:28.240
zero.

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:49.680
Only I know your pain...

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:52.180
Your uncertainty...

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:55.510
Your loneliness...

00:01:56.190 --> 00:02:00.600
If only we could be together forever.

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:06.650
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:16.790
I will not betray you!

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:07.550
Shusei!

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:12.560
To Be a "Pair"

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:31.040
<i>Master Stroke!</i>

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:47.050
Not bad, Giou Zweilt.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.180
You're Ashley?

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:53.310
Don't you mean Ashley-sama?

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:55.550
Yuki, get Shusei.

00:04:55.550 --> 00:04:56.600
Got it.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.520
Stop!

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:59.730
Let's do this! Me and you!

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:06.070
You're a lively one.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:20.170
Shusei-kun!

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:23.630
Hang in there, Shusei-kun!

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.680
Shusei-kun...

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:33.890
I won't let you hurt him.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:39.830
This is pointless.
That Zweilt will never wake up again.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:42.650
I made him part of my collection.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.290
What does that mean?

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:47.780
He's a beautiful, silent doll.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:52.450
I'll let you sleep beside
him for all of eternity!

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:58.050
What did you do to Shusei?

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:01.580
I didn't do anything to him.

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:03.920
This is what he wanted.

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:05.590
Don't be absurd!

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:15.590
Watch your tone with me, human!

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:17.590
Hotsuma-kun!

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:18.640
Stay back!

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.540
You look after Shusei.

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:26.440
I'll take care of her.

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:32.040
You're speaking nonsense.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:38.220
Shusei wanted this?

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:41.960
There's no way that's true!

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.880
Is he truly that important to you?

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:00.770
Of course!

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:03.770
Really? How unfortunate...

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.730
It appears he didn't feel
the same way about you.

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:08.320
What?

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:16.200
He wished for his own death,
so I stopped his heart.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:22.500
If he cared for you,
do you really think he'd do that?

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:27.550
Shusei wanted to die...

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:32.220
That expression is too much.

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.350
Moron.

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:47.070
I only did this because you fought me.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:50.510
But I guess you can't hear me.

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:51.820
Stop!

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:58.410
Are you going to entertain me next?

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:06.210
Yuki.

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:17.050
Let's see what kind of face you'll make.

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:20.220
No!

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:24.690
You need to have a more pained expression.

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:30.560
You're just not worth tormenting
if you look prepared for it.

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:35.240
I know!
I'll kill him first!

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:40.740
That's an improvement.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:43.870
Now, show me something even better!

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:48.840
It's only one person!

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.380
I can feel the power!

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.460
Amazing! Amazing!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:05.770
To save him, you intend
to sacrifice yourself?

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:11.730
Stop this foolishness.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:13.980
You don't understand.

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:25.580
You don't understand what it means
to protect the friends you love.

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:30.650
Listen to you.

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.170
You're right.

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:34.450
Hotsuma-kun.

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:36.300
You're awake.

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:40.010
Yeah. We're not done yet.

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:44.010
You should have stayed asleep.

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:46.180
There's nothing you can do!

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:51.230
Hotsuma-kun!

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:52.310
S-Stay back!

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:55.100
Don't worry about me.

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.650
Take care of Shusei.

00:09:58.530 --> 00:09:59.660
Okay.

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.810
It's futile.

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:09.330
God's Light,

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:13.040
watch as your friends die.

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:18.470
<i>Did you get in a fight again?</i>

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.430
<i>I didn't start it.</i>

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:23.980
<i>You're always covered in wounds.</i>

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:26.930
<i>What do you want?</i>

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:30.560
<i>I heard you calling me.</i>

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:37.070
<i>You're my one and only partner.</i>

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:50.660
Hotsuma-kun! Hotsuma-kun!

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:57.190
This is the end.

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:59.590
I won't let you die.

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:07.280
After you dragged me back to this world,

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:10.980
you're going to die by yourself?

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:12.930
Don't be ridiculous!

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:17.610
I thought you were my partner.

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:20.990
No matter how painful or pathetic...

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:24.700
We live. We live!

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:27.720
I thought we would keep living, together-

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:28.870
Give it up!

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.160
He's dead!

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:38.180
He betrayed you and chose to die alone!

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:44.970
Hotsuma-kun!
Hang in there, Hotsuma-kun!

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.330
Dear God,

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:56.270
if you gave me this damned power
to protect humans,

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:59.270
grant me the strength to fight now.

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:02.000
Shusei!

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:07.290
<i>Live!</i>

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:36.510
I won't let you hurt my partner anymore.

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:49.160
Shusei-kun...

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:03.170
What's going on?

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:06.380
Shusei-kun.

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:08.640
Thank you, Yuki.

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:10.300
I'm so relieved.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:12.220
Hotsuma.

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:16.040
Are you okay?

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.800
Your voice woke me.

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:27.330
Took you long enough.

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:39.130
I'll hear your excuses later.

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:44.050
Unforgivable...

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:48.240
You ruined my clothes.

00:13:48.980 --> 00:13:51.760
You'll pay for this!

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:52.630
Yuki.

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:54.000
Yes.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.230
This is dangerous. Stand back.

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:57.290
Please.

00:13:57.290 --> 00:13:59.100
Just do it, Yuki.

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:12.230
Ready, Shusei?

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:13.870
Yes.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.710
How many times must I tell you it's pointless?

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:28.760
Do you know why Zweilts work in pairs?

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.640
A Zweilt pair acts as one.

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:37.220
Now I've got you!

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:41.440
Don't get ahead of yourself!

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:49.360
Shusei!

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:04.290
Amazing...

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:15.140
They move as one.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:18.140
Just a minute ago, you were dying!

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:34.490
They made a shield, huh?

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:37.840
But they won't be able to see me now.

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:43.460
What? They can see me?

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:47.210
Hotsuma, two o'clock.

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:54.890
Thirty-five degrees up, at forty meters,
give or take ten centimeters.

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:57.100
Got it.

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:08.090
This is how Zweilts fight...

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:11.110
Two as one.

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:14.740
It's over.

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:20.700
They're so much more powerful together.

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:28.750
Shusei-kun!

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:35.440
Shusei! Shusei!

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:36.800
Shusei-kun!

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:42.930
Damn... I missed.

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:45.600
I'm rusty.
Guess my hand slipped.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:49.690
Well, at least I hit one.

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.530
You did this to Shusei?

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:56.660
Watch where you're looking.

00:16:58.670 --> 00:16:59.740
Hotsuma-kun!

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.500
You're not the only ones who work in pairs.

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:08.860
Yuki!

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:16.090
Let's do this!

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:20.510
Two Opasts, at a time like this...

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.680
Play time is over.

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:28.410
I just wanted to add you to my collection.

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:34.440
You've caused quite a bit of trouble!

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:40.070
Yuki...

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:50.420
Over here!

00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:53.880
Yuki, Shusei...

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.750
Yuki, run...

00:17:56.750 --> 00:18:00.010
I won't do that!

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.820
You're making that face again.

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:09.150
Didn't I tell you I hate that expression?

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.630
If you really want to die so much,

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:16.150
I'll kill you both!

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:33.100
Impossible...

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:56.460
Sorry I'm late.

00:18:58.440 --> 00:18:59.650
Luka.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:01.300
I'll handle them.

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:01.910
Right.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.580
You'll pay for killing Ashley!

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:19.880
Jekyll!

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:22.970
<i>Kurai Kurodiomedesu.</i>

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:42.160
Is it over?

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:43.580
Yes.

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:45.410
Shusei!

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:47.590
Are you all right?

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:49.620
Yes, thanks to Yuki.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:50.890
I see.

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:54.080
We don't have time to worry about that.

00:19:54.680 --> 00:19:56.500
Finish them off.

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.200
Why do I have to do it?

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:00.960
You owe me one.

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:22.690
What's this?

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:25.300
This sudden chill...

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:43.330
Stay back, Yuki.

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:45.610
It's Reiga.

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:53.880
That's Reiga?

00:21:45.190 --> 00:21:48.360
Kanata-san...

00:21:53.420 --> 00:21:57.550
Kanata-san is Reiga?

00:22:01.030 --> 00:22:02.330
No...

00:23:35.650 --> 00:23:38.750
Look, Tsukumo! I bought vegetable chips.

00:23:38.750 --> 00:23:39.600
Vegetable chips?

00:23:39.600 --> 00:23:43.650
Yeah. You eat too many snacks,
so I thought these would be healthier.

00:23:43.650 --> 00:23:45.820
Thank you. I'll eat them with chocolate,
whipped cream, and honey.

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:47.030
The Irony of Fate

00:23:47.030 --> 00:23:49.750
That defeats the purpose!
